{
  "slug": "sumup",
  "name": "Sumup",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "SumUp payment integrations across terminal and online checkout flows. Build Android and iOS POS apps with SumUp card readers, online checkout with server SDKs and the checkout widget, and control card readers remotely via Cloud API.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **6 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (6): `sumup` (Implement SumUp checkout flows end-to-end), `sumup-best-practices` (Pick the right SumUp integration path and apply security best practices), `sumup-debug` (Troubleshoot common SumUp integration failures), `sumup-mcp` (Use the SumUp MCP server (https://mcp.sumup.com/mcp) from Cursor, Claude Code, Codex, or any MCP-capable client), `sumup-testing` (Set up and run SumUp sandbox tests), `upgrade-sumup` (Guide for upgrading SumUp API versions and server/mobile SDKs (@sumup/sdk, sumup-go, sumup Python, PHP, Java, Rust, .NET, iOS…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `sumup`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install sumup@claude-plugins-official` from `sumup/sumup-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
